@startuml
[*] --> Unregistered : Initial State
Unregistered --> Registered : User creates an account
Registered --> Logged In : User logs in successfully
Logged In --> Checking Weather : User enters a valid location
Checking Weather --> Viewing Additional Details : User chooses to view additional details
Viewing Additional Details --> Ending Session : User views additional details and then logs out

Checked Location is Valid --> Checking Weather : New location entered is valid
Invalid Location Entered --> Unregistered : New location entered is not valid
Registration Failed --> Unregistered : Registration is not successful
User Logs Out --> Ending Session : User ends the session

@enduml
